<title>UK: Morgan Stanley leads Brazil repackaged bonds.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley leads Brazil repackaged bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BRAZIL REPACKAGED BONDS LTD</p>
