<p> NOTES	*STEPS DOWN TO 10.625 PCT ON 15.OCT.99</p>
<p>	    **DEAL CALLABLE AT PAR EVERY COUPON DATE FROM</p>
<p>15.OCT.99  </p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
